    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d155">

                <pb facs="0295" n="265" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v5/pg265"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 16.</note>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Mr. Fish to Mr. Bancroft.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1872-10-24"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 24, 1872.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Congratulations on the award. The President directs thanks, in which I concur,
                    for your able management of the case.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FISH.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
